      "side": 1,
      "message": "Done! The root cause was in chromiumos-overlay\u0027s sys-libs/libcxx/libcxx-9999.ebuild, where -DLIBCXXABI_ENABLE_EXCEPTIONS\u003dOFF and -DLIBCXX_ENABLE_EXCEPTIONS\u003dOFF were passed for riscv* targets as a temporary workaround for b/409825194 until Zephyr\u0027s cplusplus-rom.ld handled .eh_frame when CONFIG_CPP_EXCEPTIONS\u003dn. Since cplusplus-rom.ld now discards .eh_frame and provides the __eh_frame_* symbols when !defined(CONFIG_CPP_EXCEPTIONS), I uploaded https://crrev.com/c/8529994 to enable exceptions in libcxx/libcxxabi for RISC-V baremetal (matching armv7m-cros-eabi), removed the exception_lib.cc workaround from this CL, and added Cq-Depend: chromium:8529994.",
